+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+.. deprecated:: 2.4
+.. versionremoved:: 8.0
+
+Several behaviors of :meth:`Parser.addoption <pytest.Parser.addoption>` are now
+removed in pytest 8 (deprecated since pytest 2.4.0):
